          <mxGeometry x="-83" y="680" width="1083" height="480" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ucz5oc1tQ_gqK34lssXy-52" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;1) Application Developer uses Accelerator UI &lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px ; border: none ; padding: 0px ; font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;  a) Upload the OpeAPI XML&lt;br&gt;  b) Enter Service name, replicas, Port info , LB Type etc&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;2) CDK will create repositories for &lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;blockquote style=&quot;margin: 0px 0px 0px 40px ; border: none ; padding: 0px ; font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;  a)  Repository to store CDK Code&lt;br&gt;  b)  Repository to store App code and add hooks for code build&lt;br&gt;  c)  Repository to store K8s Manifest&lt;br&gt;  d)  Argo CD project and associate with the above K8 Manifest repo&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 17px&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;3) Code generator will create the application code with Docker file&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;4) Code will be pushed into App code repo which will initiate Code build , where in docker image is built, tagged with build id and pushed to ECR&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;5) Another code build project will be initiated which will checkout K8 manifest repo, generate K8s Yaml manifest with updated ECR image and push it to K8s Manifest Repo&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;6) Build phase will push the yaml files to k8s manifest repo, which will initiate a Argo CD deployment to EKS&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry y="719" width="900" height="430" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ucz5oc1tQ_gqK34lssXy-53" value="." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=17;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="-220" y="175" width="20" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="ucz5oc1tQ_gqK34lssXy-54" value="." style="text;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;resizable=0;points=[];autosize=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1">
